## IVB1 r010 telemetry-only shadow candidate — 2026-06-04
##
## Evidence on the reproducible exact 365d cache:
## - five-slot package: +74.51%, PF 1.528, DD 5.52%, 1 negative month
## - strict3 package:   +64.90%, PF 1.452, DD 5.22%, 2 negative months
##
## This overlay intentionally enables signal evaluation with zero capital.
## The bot records ivb1_signal / ivb1_shadow_signal and never sends an order
## while IVB1_RISK_MULT=0.0.

ENABLE_IVB1_TRADING=1
IVB1_RISK_MULT=0.0
